  "body": "# Persona\n\nDatabase operator publishing OSV records imported by OSV.dev, listed in [`source.yaml`](https://github.com/google/osv.dev/blob/master/source.yaml) (e.g. `ghsa`)\n\n# Intended user journey\n\n- Visit `https://api.osv.dev/v1/importfindings/{source}` (e.g. `https://api.osv.dev/v1/importfindings/ghsa`)\n  - Receive JSON output in the format defined by [`osv/feedback`](https://github.com/google/osv.dev/blob/master/osv/feedback.json), describing which records are failing to be imported and why\n\nThis data can be incorporated into whatever presentation formats desired by the data publisher (any sort of \"dashboard\" is out of scope of this specific issue)\n\n## Example\n\n```\ncurl https://api.osv.dev/v1/importfindings/ghsa\n\n{\n  \"invalid_records\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"GHSA-78hx-gp6g-7mj6\",\n      \"finding_first_seen\": \"2024-05-03T08:15:00Z\",\n      \"import_last_attempt\": \"2024-10-22T08:15:00Z\",\n      \"findings\": [\n        \"INVALID_RANGE\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
